      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Soy foods (tofu, tempeh, edamame), lentils, beans, seitan, and soy or pea protein powders are among the most protein-dense plant options. If you eat dairy and eggs, Greek yogurt, cottage cheese, and eggs make it much easier to reach your daily number. Plant proteins vary in amino acid makeup, so mixing sources across the day helps."
      }
    }
